t-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">나. 모집인원 </span></span></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">: 약 40명(모집인원은 일본 정부 사정에 따라 달라질 수 있음)</span></span></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">다. 지원자격</span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">1) 연령 : 1981년 4월 2일 이후 출생한 자</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LETTER-